22:56.070 --> 22:57.240
Kenapa awak pula?

22:59.030 --> 23:00.160
Saya kenal awakkah?

23:00.680 --> 23:01.440
Keji.

23:03.730 --> 23:04.640
Awak tak kenal saya,

23:04.640 --> 23:05.830
